NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across Mid Wales — a complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We add new pages every month to grow your Google visibility.

## Plans from £20/month inc. VAT

- **Starter — £20/month inc. VAT** — 5 new pages added per month
- **Growth — £35/month inc. VAT** — 10 new pages added per month
- **Scale — £50/month inc. VAT** — unlimited new pages added per month

See our [managed starter websites service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) for full plan details.

## Areas we cover across Mid Wales

We offer managed starter websites for businesses throughout Mid Wales, including [Aberystwyth](/managed-starter-websites-aberystwyth/), [Newtown](/managed-starter-websites-newtown/), [Welshpool](/managed-starter-websites-welshpool/), [Llandrindod Wells](/managed-starter-websites-llandrindod-wells/), [Brecon](/managed-starter-websites-brecon/), [Machynlleth](/managed-starter-websites-machynlleth/), [Builth Wells](/managed-starter-websites-builth-wells/), [Hay-on-Wye](/managed-starter-websites-hay-on-wye/), and surrounding areas. We also cover [South Wales](/blog/managed-starter-websites-south-wales/), [North Wales](/managed-starter-websites-north-wales/), and the rest of [Wales](/managed-starter-websites-wales/).

## Frequently asked questions

**Do you work in Mid Wales?**

Yes — we work with businesses across all of Wales and the UK.

**Is there a contract?**

There's a minimum 6-month term, then rolling monthly with 30 days' notice.

